# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
# Any other scratch log (build / type-check output captured by tooling).
# Without this, throwaway logs created while debugging a build get committed by
# a blanket `git add -A` and have to be deleted again afterwards.
*.log

